<title>USA: Costa Rica Int'l Q4 net before taxes up.</title>
<headline>Costa Rica Int'l Q4 net before taxes up.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI, Fla. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net before tax	    $734		     $371</p>
<p> Oper Profit		1,107			856</p>
<p> Revs			15,603		   13,971</p>
<p> Shares		     4,550			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The company has not yet released full-year results. Full company name is Costa Rica International Inc. Its major subsidiary is Corporacion Pipasa, Costa Rica's largest poultry products producer with 1995 assets of about $46 million.</p>
</text>
